{"id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#thm:gauss-green-theorem","title":"thm:gauss-green-theorem","path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC.md","line":29,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC.tex#thm:gauss-green-theorem","uses":["[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:ck-boundary-regularity]]","[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC.tex","label":"thm:gauss-green-theorem","line":69,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Gauss--Green Theorem]\n\\label{thm:gauss-green-theorem}\n\\uses{def:ck-boundary-regularity, def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative}\n\\dcref{appC:thm-1}\n\\group{Gauss-Green Theorem}\n\nIf $u\\in C^1(\\overline U)$, then for $i=1,\\ldots,n$,\n\\[\n(1)\\qquad\n\\int_Uu_{x_i}\\,dx\n=\\int_{\\partial U}u\\nu^i\\,dS.\n\\]\n\\end{theorem}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Gauss--Green Theorem] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a67617573732d677265656e2d7468656f72656d\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixC%23def%3Ack-boundary-regularity\">↗ def:ck-boundary-regularity</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixC%23def%3Aoutward-normal-and-normal-derivative\">↗ def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. appC:thm-1</span></span>\\group Gauss-Green Theorem <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u\\in C^1(\\overline U)$\">$u\\in C^1(\\overline U)$</span>, then for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$i=1,\\ldots ,n$\">$i=1,\\ldots ,n$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  (1)\\qquad \\int _Uu_{x_i}\\, dx =\\int _{\\partial U}u\\nu ^i\\, dS.  \\]\">\\[  (1)\\qquad \\int _Uu_{x_i}\\, dx =\\int _{\\partial U}u\\nu ^i\\, dS.  \\]</span> ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#thm:integration-by-parts-formula","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:ck-boundary-regularity","title":"def:ck-boundary-regularity","label":"def:ck-boundary-regularity"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative","title":"def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative","label":"def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#thm:integration-by-parts-formula","title":"thm:integration-by-parts-formula","label":"thm:integration-by-parts-formula"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#thm:gauss-green-theorem","title":"thm:gauss-green-theorem","tex":"\\begin{theorem}[Gauss--Green Theorem]\n\\label{thm:gauss-green-theorem}\n\\uses{def:ck-boundary-regularity, def:outward-normal-and-normal-derivative}\n\\dcref{appC:thm-1}\n\\group{Gauss-Green Theorem}\n\nIf $u\\in C^1(\\overline U)$, then for $i=1,\\ldots,n$,\n\\[\n(1)\\qquad\n\\int_Uu_{x_i}\\,dx\n=\\int_{\\partial U}u\\nu^i\\,dS.\n\\]\n\\end{theorem}","source":"tex/references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:ck-boundary-regularity","title":"def:ck-boundary-regularity","description":""},{"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixC#def:out